        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Sock, Raffaella Reggi, Liezel Huber, Bob Bryan, Melanie Oudin\n- Organizations: Association of Tennis Professionals\n- Events: 2011 US Open – Mixed Doubles\n- Roles: professional tennis players, defending champions\n\nFacts:\n- Raffaella Reggi, born on 27 November 1965, is a former professional tennis player from Italy.\n- Jack Sock, born on September 24, 1992, is an American professional tennis player.\n- Jack Sock was ranked world No. 21 in men's singles by the Association of Tennis Professionals.\n- Liezel Huber and Bob Bryan entered the 2011 US Open – Mixed Doubles as the defending champions.\n- Melanie Oudin and Jack Sock defeated Liezel Huber and Bob Bryan in the second round of the 2011 US Open – Mixed Doubles.",
